            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A child bed (1) according to the application includes a frame (100), and the frame includes: several vertical support members (183), provided at corners (101) of the frame(100); two top side rods (120), respectively extending longitudinally and being arranged transversely opposite to each other on the vertical support members (183), and each of the top side rods (120) is able to vertically slide between a high position and a low position with respect to the vertical support members (183); two side pull-rods (140), respectively extending longitudinally and being arranged transversely opposite to each other below the corresponding top side rods (120); and two tightening mechanisms (160), wherein each of the tightening mechanisms (160) serves to assist in dragging the side pull-rod (140) from one side towards the opposite side, thereby dragging the corresponding top side rod (120) to a low position.</p>
            </abstract>
